  "id": "bioecological-model",
  "term": "bioecological model",
  "definition": "The bioecological model is a view of human development that explains a person’s growth or life course through ongoing interactions between personal characteristics and multiple layers of surrounding context. In this perspective, outcomes such as career development are shaped together by the individual and their environment.",
